        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"253990\">@fitzgen (he/him)</span> if you're curious <code>--return-call-ref</code> is the flag in <code>wasm-tools component new</code> and <code>wasm-component-ld</code> which uses <code>call_ref</code> for indirect shims. If you compile with <code>-Clink-arg=--import-memory</code> then that's what skips most shims</p>",
